RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 8183A4B
	.string "Yo, how's it going?\p"
	.string "Listen, my friend!\n"
	.string "Would you like to become the CHAMPION?\p"
	.string "I'm no TRAINER, not me, but I can\n"
	.string "sure give you winning advice.\p"
	.string "That's settled, then! We'll aim for the\n"
	.string "DIGIMON CHAMPIONSHIP together!\p"
	.string "It's your job as a TRAINER to collect\n"
	.string "DIGITAL KEYS, am I right?\p"
	.string "But GYM LEADERS aren't pushovers!\p"
	.string "And that's where I come in!\n"
	.string "I'm here to provide expert advice!\p"
	.string "ROXANNE, the GYM LEADER, is a user\n"
	.string "of ROCK-type DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "The ROCK type is very durable, but\n"
	.string "it can't stand WATER-type and\l"
	.string "GRASS-type moves.\p"
	.string "Come see me afterwards, if you beat\n"
	.string "the GYM LEADER.\p"
	.string "Well, go for it!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 8183C90
	.string "Whoa! What a breathtaking victory!\n"
	.string "My cheering must've worked!\p"
	.string "Great!\n"
	.string "Check your TRAINER CARD.\p"
	.string "The STONE KEY you got should be\n"
	.string "properly recorded on it.\p"
	.string "In other words...\p"
	.string "You've climbed the first step on\n"
	.string "the stairs to the CHAMPIONSHIP!\p"
	.string "That's got to feel awesome!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_JoshIntro:: @ 8183D99
	.string "Don't take us GYM TRAINERS lightly!\n"
	.string "I'll show you why we're better!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_JoshDefeat:: @ 8183DDD
	.string "You were too good for me...$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_JoshPostBattle:: @ 8183DF9
	.string "You haven't seen anything of the ROCK\n"
	.string "type's terrifying power!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TommyIntro:: @ 8183E38
	.string "If you can't beat me, you won't stand\n"
	.string "a chance against ROXANNE!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TommyDefeat:: @ 8183E78
	.string "Wow! You've got some potential!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_TommyPostBattle:: @ 8183E98
	.string "ROXANNE is stronger than me by\n"
	.string "several times.\p"
	.string "You'd better be on your guard!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneIntro:: @ 8183EE5
	.string "ROXANNE: I guard the STONE KEY,\n"
	.string "one of eight locks on the way\p"
	.string "home.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxanneDefeat:: @ 8183FC4
	.string "ROXANNE: Your bond endured. The\n"
	.string "STONE KEY now belongs to you.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedStoneBadge:: @ 81840AB
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 1:\n"
	.string "STONE!$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_StoneBadgeInfoTakeThis:: @ 81840D5
	.string "The STONE KEY restores access to\n"
	.string "CUT outside battle. Its other\p"
	.string "battle permissions remain\n"
	.string "active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_ExplainRockTomb:: @ 8184170
	.string "That TM39 contains ROCK TOMB.\p"
	.string "It not only inflicts damage by dropping\n"
	.string "rocks, it also lowers SPEED.\p"
	.string "If you use a TM, it instantly teaches\n"
	.string "the move to a DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "Remember, a TM can be used only once,\n"
	.string "so think before you use it.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_RoxannePostBattle:: @ 8184252
	.string "You have the STONE KEY. Keep\n"
	.string "seeking the remaining guardians.\p"
	.string "The gate home needs all eight.\n"
	.string "Your partner is your anchor; do\p"
	.string "not lose hope.$"

RustboroCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:: @ 81842CC
	.string "RUSTBORO CITY DIGIMON GYM$"

